# Raw observed output — the two MPD switches become /settings checkboxes (2026-10-13, win32)

## The mechanism (quoted from the repo's own measured doc)
packages/mpd-config-plugin/src/settings-schema.ts :: markVolatile
  "MEASURED out of the installed `dsh-settings@0.1.7-rc.2`: its `volatileForm(schema)` walks
   `schema.meta.volatile`, `schema.dict`, `type`, `list` and `inner` -- PLAIN DATA on a schema object --
   and AN ENTRY WHOSE SCHEMA CARRIES NO VOLATILE NODE IS NOT LISTED IN THE DIALOG AT ALL."
=> mpd-config marked its own Config volatile; mpd-tui did NOT, which is why `panel`/`workmate` had
   no checkbox and the two pages read as un-toggleable.

